DOCUMENT();

loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'PGML.pl', 'parserPopUp.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');

$tf = DropDownTF("False");

BEGIN_PGML
Indicate whether the following statement is true or false.

[_]{$tf} The set {0} forms a basis for the zero subspace.
END_PGML

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
FALSE. The set {0} is linearly dependent, and thus cannot be a basis. The basis of the subspace {0} is the empty set.
END_PGML_SOLUTION

ENDDOCUMENT();
